 "stimulus_html": "<figure id=\"fig05\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/f445e632e4914fc2.png\" alt=\"Men stack boxes of TNT that reach above their heads. The boxes are labeled “Tennessee Powder Company.”\">\n<figcaption>Cases of TNT gunpowder shipped from the United States under the 1941 Lend-Lease Act were stacked in a tunnel dug out of solid rock 100 feet underground in western England.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
 "questions": [
